WEBVTT

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.780
There once lived a great
and terrible dragon,

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:17.540
who could wield hellfire as his own and
burn a kingdom to ash in a single night.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.040
We called him the Flame Dragon Lord.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.550
This evil being, covered
in the blood of his enemies,

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.550
wreaked a path of death and
destruction like never seen before.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.680
Countless Heroes rallied to face him,

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.810
to end his apocalyptic terror,

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:41.810
but all were turned to ash
in mere instants.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.070
The Flame Dragon Lord
and his dark followers

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:45.020
Flame Dragon Lord

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:50.030
appeared seemingly at random,
committing reprehensible acts of terror,

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:54.370
forcing thousands of innocents to live
in fear of their next horrific appearance.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.290
In the midst of this chaos,

00:00:56.290 --> 00:01:01.040
the Princess of Eos disappeared.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:07.250
The king rallied his soldiers
to search for the missing princess,

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.680
but just as they had left
the castle defenseless,

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:16.890
the Flame Dragon appeared
behind the castle walls,

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.980
with the princess as his hostage...

