00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.990
Flame Dragon Lord!

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:02.330
We have you surrounded!

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:06.620
If you value your life,
surrender the castle

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.670
and release my daughter!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:13.800
Respond, or we shall take your silence
as a declaration of war and attack!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:19.850
Our noble kingdom will never bow down
to those who consort with darkness!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:27.640
You'll rue the day you chose to bring
harm against this great kingdom!

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.440
How did I end up in this situation?!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:40.450
When you escaped the labyrinth and
made your way into the castle proper...

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.660
This is the palace!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.540
You panicked and tried to run away.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.540
Wh-What do we do?!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.170
Let's jump out the window!

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.040
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.750
Not you again!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.880
Then, you ran into the Heroes.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.930
Damn you, Flame Dragon Lord! Now
you've come to attack the royal palace?!

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.840
I'm leaving right now!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.470
Then they started chasing you...

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.810
Hey, drummox! Stop treating me
like a sack of potatoes!

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.560
Halt, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.520
What? The Flame Dragon Lord?!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.900
Come on! You're hurting me!

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:13.610
Halt, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:14.480
Wait, is that the princess?!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.860
Dearia! Help me!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.320
With this sword of justice, I smite thee--

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.330
...so I took care of the Heroes.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.920
Your Majesty!

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.170
The Flame Dragon Lord has taken over
the palace, and he has the princess!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.930
What?!

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:42.470
I think that about covers it.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.180
My, he looks quite angry.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.220
Could this get any worse?!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:51.230
It seems the king believes
you kidnapped Nell, Letty.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:55.900
I know! You could just tell your dad
what really happened!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:56.820
Please?

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.530
Absolutely not!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:03.660
Have you already forgotten how
my father brazenly insulted me before?!

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.530
Have some tea, father!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:09.960
Oh, thank you.
I'll have one of these, too.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.290
I didn't say you could
have a cupcake, too!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.880
Nell!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.460
I refuse to speak to him until he
comes crawling to me for forgiveness!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:20.380
All this over a cupcake?!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.630
Couldn't we use magic to escape, Dearia?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.630
Unfortunately, no.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:24.260
Huh?!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.720
This castle is warded
against teleportation magic

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.140
to keep out potential intruders.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.140
You could've told us that earlier!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:34.350
M-Maybe we could go back into the
sewers and teleport from down there?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.940
Do you not remember how lost
we were down there?! No, thanks!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.400
Very well.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.320
Let us defend ourselves.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.650
Huh?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:49.780
Building Basics with Dearia

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.740
It's time for...

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.200
...<i>Building Basics with Dearia</i>!

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.040
Today: castle defenses.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.780
Castle Defenses

00:05:49.780 --> 00:06:03.170
Building Basics with Dearia

00:05:49.780 --> 00:06:03.170
Castle Defenses

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:54.670
Castles are built to defend their
dwellers from outside threats.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:59.800
Let's build ourselves a line of defense.
You may need this knowledge later, Letty.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.260
He sure is into this.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.090
When did he get his own TV show?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.180
First order of business...

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.110
The heck?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.230
PYAAAA

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.450
Control and seal off all outer gates,
and take care of the guards.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.620
PIIII!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.290
PIIII!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:43.380
Now, all the important access points
are under our control.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.340
Wonderful work, Piyovelt!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.560
I hope we're doing the right thing...

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.930
All that's left is the drawbridge.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.270
Charge!

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:58.110
But the royal army has likely crossed it
already, so no need to worry about that.

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:58.980
Huh?!

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.150
Doesn't that mean that huge army's
gonna come charging in here?!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.280
Calm down. It will be all right.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:10.030
The castle is surrounded by a moat
and only has one point of entry.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:16.120
This restricts the flow of enemy
combatants into your defenses.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:16.120
It's too narrow!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:16.200
"It's too narrow!"

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:20.710
And our three layers of defense
should be more than sufficient.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:20.750
Gate: Sealed

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.750
Gate: Sealed

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.750
Gate: Sealed

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.710
Let's move onto our counterattack.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.590
Yes!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.720
Wait, Nell!

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.470
What are you doing? Let go of me!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:32.970
You should stay here in the castle.
We're gonna go fight your dad, after all.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.980
Don't you think I know that?!

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.350
Huh?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.480
Your Majesty, the inner gates are sealed!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.770
But even knowing that...

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.280
I can't abandon my friends
when they're in trouble!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.610
Others might, but I could never forgive
myself if I abandoned you here!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.960
Papa?

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:59.460
She said we're her friends.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:04.670
So I'm going to do something
for Nell... and all my friends!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.590
The forces you see down there...

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.970
...are the vanguard of the royal army.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.270
That's quite obvious!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.230
Observe the surrounding area.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:21.150
This is a defensive layout
called a "Lion's Den."

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:26.360
With the next gate to the side, intruders
cannot attack in a straight line.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:30.320
It also leaves them open to focused
fire from the surrounding walls.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:35.290
But we don't have any archers.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.120
Letty, go breathe fire on them.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.210
No way! My tongue can't handle the heat!

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.670
I've called for reinforcements.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.340
Wait, who?

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.970
The gnomes!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:52.470
We'll pelt them with rocks.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.520
Ready, aim...

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:58.730
Fire!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.730
Enemy attack!

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:03.730
The Flame Dragon Lord?!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.360
I don't know!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:09.530
Suppression fire is one
of the basics of warfare.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.990
There are loopholes and
betreches in every wall.

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.490
Ow!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:18.200
Winding passages make it all the easier
to attack from multiple vantage points.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.830
You can also lurk behind corners
to ambush enemies.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.960
No way, no how, that is not happening!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.720
Status report!

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:35.260
Enemy reinforcements are
barring us from proceeding further!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.850
We believe they're with the Flame
Dragon Lord, but we've yet to spot him!

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.640
Then I'll infiltrate the castle
via the secret passage!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.850
You mustn't, Your Majesty!

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.520
There may be others within the walls
besides the Flame Dragon Lord!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.780
Has anyone actually spotted him?!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.110
Uh...

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.870
Did you see that dragon just now?

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:58.700
Wait, what?!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.620
I saw the Flame Dragon Lord go that way!

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:01.540
I'll be safe he--

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.330
Sorry!

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:05.660
What was that?

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.670
The Flame Dragon Lord?!

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.550
I saw a red dragon peek out of
a trap door, then run away in a panic...

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:12.300
What in the world?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:16.430
Is he mocking us?
Curse you, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.310
Is someone talking about me?

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.310
Perhaps they're laughing at you
for being such a loser.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.270
You were <i>supposed </i>to ambush
them from the trapdoor,

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.030
but you ran off as soon as
they spotted you.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:34.950
Knowing my father, he'll probably
withdraw to regroup.

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.240
We can escape when he does!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.370
We just have to hold out a bit longer!

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.420
They're still going?!

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:52.460
Just go home! Do you know how
annoying this is for the few of us?!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.050
Not only that...

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.550
We've reached the last gate!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.680
But they've breached all of our
defenses except for the last one!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.890
Where did those gnomes go?!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.020
As soon as they disappeared,
we lost all of our defensive ground!

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.770
They went home at five.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.480
Make them stay late!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.730
We treat our workers
with respect, thank you.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:14.860
Come, this is a wonderful opportunity
to teach you about the portcullis.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.240
It would behoove you
to have a reaction sometimes!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.870
Typical Dearia.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:22.830
The portcullis can be used for both
defensive and offensive maneuvers.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:22.830
It's opening? It's open!

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.790
First, raise the lattice grating...

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:26.290
Why?!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:29.710
Once the enemy enters...

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:29.710
Now's our chance! Charge!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:35.220
Move to the inside grating and close it...

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.430
No! We're trapped!

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:43.680
...trapping the enemy.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.020
We're trapped!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:49.860
Curse you, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:49.860
These small openings
are called "murder holes."

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:55.240
Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:52.150
Add just a little boiling water.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:55.360
"Hot! Hot!"

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.240
You're not making instant ramen, here...

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.990
You can use rocks,
arrows, and hot oil, too,

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:00.950
or employ trapdoors that
drop the enemy into pitfalls.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:01.870
Wow!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.370
Oh, no!

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.040
They're trying to use
ladders to climb the walls!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:06.250
Huh?!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.000
And we don't have any archers
to stop them. What to do...

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.500
Flame Dragon Lord!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:16.550
Your Majesty, it's too dangerous!

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:20.590
Return my daughter safely to me
and your life will be spared!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.810
But if there is a single
scratch on her fair skin,

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:27.770
I'll flay your hide and drape
it across the castle gates!

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:30.690
Nothing is more precious to me...

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:36.360
Nothing is more precious to me
than my beloved daughter!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:40.110
No amount of treasure could replace her!

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:51.000
Nell, let's retreat into the castle!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.750
Could you show us the way?

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.760
Very well.

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:03.220
Letty, we'll be discovered
quickly if we hide there.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.180
Dearia!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.970
Could you help me with something?

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.330
Search every room top to bottom!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.750
The food stores, the privies, everywhere!

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.880
There you are, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.550
Stop, Your Majesty!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.260
It's dangerous to go alone!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.260
Halt!

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:44.050
Your Majesty!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:47.770
You will not have my daughter!

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:49.680
I-I didn't take her in the first place!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.770
The door won't open!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.730
Your Majesty, are you all right?!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.580
Father?

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:22.550
How did you know I was here?

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.550
You came alone? But--

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.350
Nell!

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.190
Are you all right?! Are you hurt?!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:40.900
I'm fine.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.320
Did he mistreat you in any way?

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:43.110
Not at all!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.070
Do you know who I am?!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.360
Of course I do!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.370
Thank goodness...

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:53.750
I'm so glad you're unharmed...

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.750
Please, forgive me, Nell.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.080
Give me three whole cakes and I will.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:02.550
Of course.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:03.420
That's a lot of cake...

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.380
With lots of whipped cream.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.220
Of course.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:07.090
Seems it went as planned.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.270
Thanks for casting a spell
to seal the door.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:16.150
You used yourself as a decoy to lure the
king here. I'm impressed by your bravery.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:20.270
I figured it would work,
since he was so mad at me.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:27.660
I just really wanted Nell
to talk with her dad.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:33.120
I had a feeling they wanted
to make up with one another.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:39.380
After I was kicked out of
my home, I felt so abandoned.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:42.250
But after seeing Nell and her father...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:55.770
I started to wonder, maybe my
father kicked me out to help me.

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:59.150
Or maybe he <i>did </i>abandon me. Who knows?

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:00.900
What a wonderful thought.

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:05.940
If that's how you've come to see things,
then I see no problem with it at all.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.120
Okay!

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:12.450
The Flame Dragon Lord?!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.620
Stay back, Nell!

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.700
Wait, Father!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.910
I'll handle him!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.880
Father, you don't understand!

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.840
Let go of me!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.750
I believe I understand.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.590
My daughter...

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:30.140
...has caused you nothing but trouble!
My deepest apologies!

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:31.720
She was no trouble at all!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:34.680
I'm sorry for getting her
involved in this mess.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.430
Why won't it open?!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.560
It must be magic!

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.230
Someone, call a mage!

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:42.060
You protected my daughter
this entire time,

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:46.610
yet I let myself be swayed by those
foul rumors about the Flame Dragon Lord.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.820
What are they saying about me <i>now</i>?!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:53.280
I'm just glad you heard me out.
The Heroes would have just attacked.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.580
Heroes are a different breed entirely.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.330
All I can say...

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:05.500
...is that every race has good and evil
amongst them, human or otherwise.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:09.630
So, you were looking to live and work
in our man-made dungeon?

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.640
Actually, after all this ruckus,
I think I'll look for somewhere else...

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.760
Then you'll be continuing your journey?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.520
Ooh!

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:20.520
I want to come, too!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:25.940
You have royal obligations
to deal with all this "ruckus."

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:26.780
Aww.

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:29.190
He's like, actually mad!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.570
So, I was wondering
how I should get out of here...

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.660
Your soldiers look ready to skin me alive.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:35.740
Open this door!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.870
I can't dispel it!

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.950
Curse you, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.170
I have just the thing.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.960
Hey, wait!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:48.300
It's fairy dust. Use this to fly away.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:52.840
That's where you were hiding it?! You know
I've been wanting to play with some!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:56.050
We'll tie up any loose ends ourselves.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.720
Thank you.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.390
How do I use this stuff?

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.470
Here, let me see.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.860
I apologize for all the trouble.

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:07.730
It's quite all right.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.780
I can't believe my daughter was traveling
with the Demon Lord himself!

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:14.030
This may not be much of an apology,

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:17.240
but I took the liberty of listing all the
items requiring maintenance in the palace.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.870
My, thank you.

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:21.660
Here, bend down.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.210
Close your eyes.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.750
This will give me the power to fly?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.290
Temporarily, yes.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.550
It's a magical placebo that gives you
flight if you believe hard enough!

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:31.380
Wait, then it's all in my head?!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.800
They do say that if you believe,
your soul will be saved!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.140
I think that's talking about
something totally different.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.300
Don't open your eyes yet!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.600
O-Okay!

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.610
See you again soon, Letty!

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.200
R-Right! See you again someday!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.450
Soon, I hope.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.080
Oh, let me give you this.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.080
Papa? Papa!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.000
Here.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.000
This is pretty!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.880
It's half of a fairy stone.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:13.970
Each half will lead you to where
the other half of the stone is.

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:18.550
When things calm down over here, I'll come
find you. Try not to die before then, yes?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.310
C'mon, don't joke about that!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.390
We should go, Letty.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:24.730
Oh, okay!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.150
I just need to believe, right?

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.540
It's no use, I can't...

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.410
Wait... what?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:54.210
I-I'm flying! For the first time
in my life, I'm flying!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.930
Thank you so much, Nell, Your Majesty!

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:59.680
Safe travels.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:04.060
Let's be off, then, Letty.

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.180
Right!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:09.690
Be sure to land before
the magic wears off!

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:11.860
Thanks for all your help!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.830
Flying is so incredible!

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:30.750
Oh, right! I've flown
one time before this!

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:31.410
Hey, Dearia?

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:32.540
Yes?

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:35.880
This world sure is fascinating, isn't it?

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:43.760
Varney.

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:45.390
What?

00:22:45.390 --> 00:22:48.430
This world sure is fascinating, is it not?

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:51.810
Wow, took you long enough
to figure that out.

00:22:57.310 --> 00:22:59.860
Huh? Was that a weird thing to say?!

00:22:59.860 --> 00:23:01.280
No, Letty.

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:02.990
It sure took you long enough
to figure that out.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:04.990
Hey, don't be mean!

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:10.580
After barricading himself and the princess
in the castle, and a long day of battle,

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:16.630
the Flame Dragon Lord vanished
as suddenly as he'd appeared.

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:20.340
His heart stolen by the
princess' unrivaled beauty,

00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:25.630
he swore not to attack the city
his beloved so cherished.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:33.390
Or so one legend of the Flame Dragon Lord,
passed down within the capital, claims.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.020
My heart was stolen by her <i>beauty</i>?

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:45.860
Is that how they spun it? The royal
propaganda machine is remarkable.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:47.320
What's wrong with that?!
